nothing to act on yet
  acts   . closed
  full   [. show or hide closed sprints]
a board with no sprint on it
  acts   c new · . closed
  full   [c plan a new sprint, . show or hide closed sprints]
a planned sprint
  acts   ! start · e edit · c new · . closed
  full   [↓/j down, ↑/k up, pgdn page down, pgup page up, g g first sprint, G / g e last sprint]
  full   [! start this sprint, e edit name, goal and dates, c plan a new sprint, . show or hide closed sprints]
a running sprint
  acts   ! complete · e edit · c new · . closed
  full   [↓/j down, ↑/k up, pgdn page down, pgup page up, g g first sprint, G / g e last sprint]
  full   [! complete this sprint, e edit name, goal and dates, c plan a new sprint, . show or hide closed sprints]
a closed sprint
  acts   e edit · c new · . closed
  full   [↓/j down, ↑/k up, pgdn page down, pgup page up, g g first sprint, G / g e last sprint]
  full   [e edit name, goal and dates, c plan a new sprint, . show or hide closed sprints]
filling a sprint in
  acts   ctrl+s send it to Jira · tab next field · esc discard this edit
  full   [tab next field, shift+tab previous field]
  full   [ctrl+s send it to Jira, esc discard this edit]
  full   [alt+k delete to end of line]
answering the confirm
  acts   y go ahead · esc leave it alone
  full   [y go ahead, esc leave it alone]
choosing where a completion sends the open issues
  acts   y go ahead · tab where the open issues go · esc leave it alone
  full   [tab where the open issues go, shift+tab back a choice]
  full   [y go ahead, esc leave it alone]
a write in flight
  acts   
